---
import { statisticsEnabled } from '../lib/statistics';
const enabled=statisticsEnabled(Astro.locals.siteContext);
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><meta name="robots" content="noindex"/><title>Optional statistics · Privacy</title></head><body><main>
<a href="/">← Back to the website</a><p class="eyebrow">Privacy / optional analytics</p><h1>Your visit. Your choice.</h1>
<p>This notice covers optional visitor statistics on this website, operated by its site owner with hosting and analytics provided by Sites by Leon. It does not replace any other privacy notice for inquiries, bookings, accounts or payments.</p>
<h2>What happens when you allow statistics?</h2><p>We record which public page category you view, the time, a broad device category, referring website category and an approximate country supplied by our hosting network. We use random, short-lived browser-tab identifiers to group views into visits. The server stores daily keyed hashes of those identifiers, not their original values. This is pseudonymous information, not identification of individual people.</p>
<p>We do not store names, raw IP addresses, precise locations, full referring addresses, query strings or private-page activity in this analytics dataset. We do not use it for advertising or fingerprinting. Network addresses are processed transiently for delivery, country estimation and abuse prevention; hosting providers may maintain separate security logs.</p>
<h2>Only after you choose Allow</h2><p>Analytics requests and analytics session storage start only after you accept. Declining does not prevent use of the website. We respect Global Privacy Control and Do Not Track signals even if you previously accepted. Browser blockers and these choices affect the totals shown to the site owner.</p>
<h2>Storage and retention</h2><p>Your Allow or Decline preference is stored locally for 180 days so we can remember it. An optional session identifier is kept in browser session storage for up to 30 minutes and resets at midnight UTC. Statistics records expire after 90 days and are removed by daily cleanup. Only authorized administrators for this site and authorized platform administrators can access its statistics.</p>
<h2>Change your choice</h2><p>Use Privacy choices on a public page to decline at any time. This stops future optional collection and clears the browser’s analytics session identifier. It does not retroactively remove previously collected records; we do not retain an identity-based link that lets us reliably locate your past visits. You can also clear this website’s browser storage.</p>
<button type="button" id="withdraw-statistics">Decline optional statistics</button><p id="choice-result" role="status"></p>
<h2>Questions or privacy requests</h2><p>Contact the site owner through <a href="/inquire">the inquiry page</a>, or contact <a href="https://leonsites.org/contact">Sites by Leon</a> about the hosted analytics service. Applicable privacy rights and requirements depend on your location and the site owner’s circumstances.</p>
<p class="note">{enabled?'Optional statistics are enabled for this site.':'Optional statistics collection is currently disabled for this site.'} Notice updated September 20, 2026.</p>
</main><script>document.getElementById('withdraw-statistics')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{try{localStorage.setItem('leon-statistics-choice-v1',JSON.stringify({value:'declined',expires:Date.now()+15552000000}));sessionStorage.removeItem('leon-statistics-session-v1');document.getElementById('choice-result')!.textContent='Optional statistics declined. You can continue using the site.';}catch{document.getElementById('choice-result')!.textContent='Your browser did not allow saving the preference. Use Privacy choices on the public page or enable a Do Not Track signal.'}});</script>
</body></html>
<style>body{margin:0;background:#f7f8f4;color:#21392b;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif}main{max-width:720px;padding:64px 24px 96px;margin:auto}h1{font-size:clamp(36px,7vw,60px);letter-spacing:-.045em;line-height:1.05;margin:20px 0 32px}h2{font-size:22px;margin-top:36px}p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:#435749}a{color:#254b37;text-underline-offset:4px}.eyebrow{margin-top:60px;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.15em}button{background:#254b37;color:white;padding:14px 20px;border:0;border-radius:5px;font:inherit;cursor:pointer}:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #ad8225;outline-offset:4px}.note{font-size:12px;margin-top:40px}</style>
